    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92867" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυσ-τάζω</span></b> , Frequentat. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρύω</span> (A), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drag
				about</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰ ῥυστάζεσκεν . . περὶ
				σῆμα</span>
			<i>he dragged</i> it many times round the grave of Patroclus,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.755
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δμῳὰς . . ῥυστάζοντας ἀεικελίως κατὰ
					δώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					16.109
				</span></i>
			; cf. sq.</div>
